---

`npx @satcomx00-x00/solow` installs one platform-specific optional dependency,
@satcomx00-x00/solow-inngest-<platform>, which carries the Inngest Dev Server
binary. That binary is Inngest's own work, redistributed unmodified under the
Server Side Public License; each of those packages ships upstream's LICENSE.md
beside it. SoloW invokes it as a separate process and neither links against nor
modifies it, so its terms apply to that binary alone and not to this product.
